# ファイナルファンタジーVI (Final Fantasy VI, Super Famicom, SFC-0ACC8D36): its characters by code, as the script
# in the cartridge has them. A code of 0x1C-0x1F and the byte after it is a kanji (four hex digits here); any other
# byte is a kana, a sign, or a word of two characters or more from the game's dictionary. Read from play: each
# page's codes, read from the cartridge where the game's pointer walked, held against its picture.
